    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt.\n\nThe text prompt asks for: \"生成一段15秒、16:9横屏的真人同事互动片段，真人影像\n\n成年女性穿浅蓝衬衫坐在木桌旁看无字册子，成年男同事穿深灰外套从后侧靠近；室内自然柔光，两人神情平和。场景中的人物均为成年人\n\n构图与光影：自然柔光同时照肩部接触与脸，桌边与书册清楚，不用浅景深藏拍肩动作\"\n\nNow let me analyze each dimension:\n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\n- The overall visual quality is moderate. The resolution is adequate but not high, with occasional mild softness in some frames.\n- Lighting remains natural and consistent, and colors are generally balanced; there are no major distortions or artifacts across the sequence.\n- Transitions between shots are smooth, and framing stays stable throughout the clip.\n- Overall, the visuals are acceptable but do not reach high-end fidelity.\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\n- The video largely aligns with the prompt: a 16:9 horizontal format, two adults (a woman in a light blue shirt and a man in a dark jacket) interacting in an indoor setting with natural lighting, and a visible book on the table.\n- The scene captures the general setup and interaction described in the prompt, including the woman looking down at the book and the man approaching from behind.\n- Some specific details from the prompt are not fully realized in the footage (e.g., the exact timing of the shoulder contact and the precise progression of the woman’s head movement), but the core elements and overall narrative alignment are present.\n- Overall alignment is strong, with only minor deviations in exact timing and motion nuances.\n\nPhysical Consistency / Common-sense:\n- The interactions appear plausible and coherent within a real-world office-like environment. Body language and spatial relationships are believable, and the sequence maintains logical continuity.\n- There are no obvious physical implausibilities; however, given the static-frame sampling, some micro-motions may be less fluid than in a live capture, which is consistent with a moderate level of common-sense realism.\n\n</multi-dimensional analysis>\n\n(1) visual quality: 3\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 3\n"
